      "author_association": "MEMBER",
      "body": "This is a refactor, only the RPC docs change minimally:\r\n\r\n```diff\r\ndiff --git a/generateblock b/generateblock\r\nindex c552f4a..e1d1cbd 100644\r\n--- a/generateblock\r\n+++ b/generateblock\r\n@@ -1,2 +1,2 @@\r\n-generateblock \"output\" [\"rawtx/txid\",...] ( submit )\r\n+generateblock \"output\" [\"rawtx_or_txid\",...] ( submit )\r\n \r\n@@ -11,3 +11,3 @@ Arguments:\r\n      [\r\n-       \"rawtx/txid\",    (string)\r\n+       \"rawtx_or_txid\",    (string)\r\n        ...\r\ndiff --git a/getnetworkinfo b/getnetworkinfo\r\nindex 33b9c69..7d075f9 100644\r\n--- a/getnetworkinfo\r\n+++ b/getnetworkinfo\r\n@@ -18,3 +18,3 @@ Result:\r\n   \"inv_buckets\" : {                                  (json object)\r\n-    \"inbound/outbound\" : {                           (json object) connection direction\r\n+    \"direction\" : {                                  (json object) connection direction (inbound or outbound)\r\n       \"backlog\" : n,                                 (numeric) number of queued txs to announce\r\ndiff --git a/getprioritisedtransactions b/getprioritisedtransactions\r\nindex a87170f..d3dc64c 100644\r\n--- a/getprioritisedtransactions\r\n+++ b/getprioritisedtransactions\r\n@@ -6,3 +6,3 @@ Result:\r\n {                                 (json object) prioritisation keyed by txid\r\n-  \"<transactionid>\" : {           (json object)\r\n+  \"transactionid\" : {             (json object)\r\n     \"fee_delta\" : n,              (numeric) transaction fee delta in satoshis\r\ndiff --git a/getrawaddrman b/getrawaddrman\r\nindex 43e3219..d44bd58 100644\r\n--- a/getrawaddrman\r\n+++ b/getrawaddrman\r\n@@ -9,3 +9,3 @@ Result:\r\n   \"table\" : {                      (json object) buckets with addresses in the address manager table ( new, tried )\r\n-    \"bucket/position\" : {          (json object) the location in the address manager table (<bucket>/<position>)\r\n+    \"bucket_and_position\" : {      (json object) address manager table location, formatted as <bucket>/<position>\r\n       \"address\" : \"str\",           (string) The address of the node\r\n",
